    "Modern red-brown masonry office with pale stone ground storey and narrow upright glazing bays. Both actual south and east elevations opened.",
    "South: main glazing portion separated by tall pale ribs; adjacent red strip has smaller isolated upper windows; dark ground entrance and shop glazing. East: similar pale vertical ribs with three regular upper rows and taller bottom office glazing row; narrow side strip has isolated windows.",
